╭─ Issue description ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Issue Title: [FEATURE] Support MCP Tasks (SEP-1686) with MCPClient                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Description:                                                                                                                                    │
│ ### Problem Statement                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ MCP just released a new specification with the ability to have long running tasks, and to poll for results with a taskId. Without this feature, │
│ it is quite complex to handle long running tasks.                                                                                               │
│ See https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/issues/1686 and                                                                │
│ https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pull/1732                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Proposed Solution                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Implement Task handling in the `MCPClient`.                                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ At the moment the MCP python SDK is not fully ready, see https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/pull/1645                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Use Case                                                                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ When agent needs MCP tools that take too long to answer synchronously (long data processing for example), the agent would trigger the task and  │
│ then poll the server to know when a task is finished.                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Alternatives Solutions                                                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Manually handle a set of tools (start / poll / get_result)                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Additional Context                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ _No response_                                                                                                                                   │
